{"bankId":"B-SRC-18-1196","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0001","constructFamily":"mean_after_removing_lowest","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah data menunjukkan lima markah kuiz. Jika markah terendah tidak diambil kira, berapakah purata empat markah yang tinggal?","options":["16.5","15","16","17.25"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah lima markah = 12 + 18 + 15 + 9 + 21 = 75.","Markah terendah ialah 9, jadi jumlah baharu = 75 − 9 = 66.","Purata = 66 ÷ 4 = 16.5."],"visual":{"kind":"five_value_data","values":[12,18,15,9,21]}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-18-1197","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0002","constructFamily":"rectangle_length_from_perimeter","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Perimeter sebuah segi empat tepat ialah 54 cm. Lebarnya 9 cm. Berapakah panjang segi empat tepat itu?","options":["9 cm","18 cm","27 cm","36 cm"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["2 × (panjang + 9) = 54.","Panjang + 9 = 27.","Panjang = 18 cm."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-18-1198","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0003","constructFamily":"rectangle_area_after_two_dimension_changes","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Rajah menunjukkan sebuah segi empat tepat 12 cm × 8 cm. Panjangnya ditambah 50% manakala lebarnya dikurangkan 25%. Berapakah luas baharu?","options":["96 cm²","112 cm²","108 cm²","144 cm²"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Panjang baharu = 12 + 50% × 12 = 18 cm.","Lebar baharu = 8 − 25% × 8 = 6 cm.","Luas baharu = 18 × 6 = 108 cm²."],"visual":{"kind":"rectangle","length_cm":12,"width_cm":8}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-18-1199","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0004","constructFamily":"cuboid_cube_layer_removal","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Sebuah kotak 8 cm × 6 cm × 4 cm diisi penuh dengan kubus kecil bersisi 2 cm. Satu lapisan penuh kubus di bahagian atas dikeluarkan. Berapakah kubus kecil yang masih tinggal?","options":["6","18","24","12"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Bilangan kubus asal = (8÷2) × (6÷2) × (4÷2) = 4 × 3 × 2 = 24.","Satu lapisan mengandungi 4 × 3 = 12 kubus.","Baki = 24 − 12 = 12."],"visual":{"kind":"cuboid","length_cm":8,"width_cm":6,"height_cm":4}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-18-1200","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0005","constructFamily":"reverse_start_time_multi_segment","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebuah tayangan tamat pada 3:10 petang. Bahagian pertama berlangsung 50 minit, rehat 15 minit dan bahagian kedua 65 minit. Pada pukul berapakah tayangan bermula?","options":["1:00 petang","12:40 tengah hari","1:10 petang","1:20 petang"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah tempoh = 50 + 15 + 65 = 130 minit = 2 jam 10 minit.","3:10 petang − 2 jam 10 minit = 1:00 petang."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-18-1201","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0006","constructFamily":"cart_percentage_discount","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Tiga buku nota berharga RM7.50 setiap satu dan dua fail berharga RM4.20 setiap satu. Kedai memberi diskaun 10% daripada jumlah belian. Berapakah jumlah yang perlu dibayar?","options":["RM27.09","RM27.81","RM28.71","RM30.90"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah asal = 3 × RM7.50 + 2 × RM4.20 = RM30.90.","Diskaun = 10% × RM30.90 = RM3.09.","Bayaran = RM30.90 − RM3.09 = RM27.81."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-18-1202","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0007","constructFamily":"combined_mean_two_groups","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Kumpulan A mempunyai 8 murid dengan purata skor 14. Kumpulan B mempunyai 12 murid dengan purata skor 16. Berapakah purata skor semua 20 murid?","options":["14.8","15","15.2","15.5"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah skor A = 8 × 14 = 112.","Jumlah skor B = 12 × 16 = 192.","Purata gabungan = (112 + 192) ÷ 20 = 15.2."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-18-1203","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0008","constructFamily":"isosceles_vertex_exterior_from_base_angle","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebuah segi tiga sama kaki mempunyai dua sudut tapak masing-masing 68°. Berapakah sudut luar pada puncaknya yang bersebelahan dengan sudut dalam puncak?","options":["44°","68°","112°","136°"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Sudut dalam puncak = 180° − 68° − 68° = 44°.","Sudut luar bersebelahan membentuk garis lurus dengan 44°.","Sudut luar = 180° − 44° = 136°."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-18-1204","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0009","constructFamily":"coordinate_net_horizontal_move","plannedLevel":2,"question":"Titik P bermula pada (2,5). P bergerak 8 unit ke kanan kemudian 3 unit ke kiri. Apakah koordinat akhir P?","options":["(7,5)","(5,5)","(7,8)","(13,5)"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Pergerakan bersih pada paksi-x = 8 − 3 = 5 unit ke kanan.","x baharu = 2 + 5 = 7, manakala y kekal 5.","Koordinat akhir ialah (7,5)."]}
